# What belongs in this repository is written down in
# docs/decisions/007-what-goes-into-git.md. Change both together.

# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.npm/
.pnpm-store/

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# dist/ is published to npm, not committed: `npm run build` regenerates it
# and a checked-in bundle conflicts on every merge.
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Test and coverage artefacts ───────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
*.lcov
.vitest/

# ── Logs and crash reports ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Local environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets never enter the journal. An .env.example may be committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Editors and OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ── Developer tooling — local to each machine, not to the project ─────
# Agent skills, caches and indexes are reinstalled per developer. The
# committed contract for agents is AGENTS.md and .kadence/README.md.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
.serena/
.cursor/
.aider*

# ── kadence's own board ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# .kadence/events/ IS the data and is committed on purpose — that is the
# whole product. state.json is a derived snapshot, rebuilt from events.
.kadence/state.json
.kadence/*.lock

# ── Лендінг ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# site/ готується тут, а живе окремим репозиторієм — ADR-008.
# Файли лишаються на диску, в історію продукту не йдуть.
site/
